"| Endpoint | Disregard | Read instead |\n"
"| --- | --- | --- |\n"
"| `GET /v1/jobs`, `GET /v1/jobs/{id}/metrics` | `usage.qpu_charge_time_seconds` | `usage.value` |\n"
"| `GET /v1/workloads` | `workloads[].usage.qpu_charge_time_seconds` | `workloads[].usage.value` |\n"
"| `POST /v1/sessions`, `GET /v1/sessions/{id}` | `elapsed_time` | `usage.value` |\n"
"| `GET /v1/instances/usage` | `usage_consumed_seconds`, `usage_limit_seconds`, `usage_allocation_seconds` | `usage_consumed_ru`, `usage_limit_ru`, `usage_allocation_ru` |\n"
"| `GET /v1/accounts/{id}` | `plans[].usage_limit_seconds`, `plans[].usage_allocation_seconds`, `plans[].unallocated_usage_seconds` | `plans[].usage_limit_ru`, `plans[].usage_allocation_ru`, `plans[].unallocated_usage_ru` |\n"
"| Resource Controller API: Create, update, and read service instances | `instance_limit_seconds`, `usage_allocation_seconds` | `instance_limit_ru`, `usage_allocation_ru` |\n"
"| `GET /v1/analytics/usage`, `GET /v1/analytics/usage_grouped`, `GET /v1/analytics/usage_grouped_by_date` | Each usage field in milliseconds | The matching field with the `_ru` suffix |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Endpunkt | Ignorieren | Stattdessen lesen |\n"
"| --- | --- | --- |\n"
"| `GET /v1/jobs`, `GET /v1/jobs/{id}/metrics` | `usage.qpu_charge_time_seconds` | `usage.value` |\n"
"| `GET /v1/workloads` | `workloads[].usage.qpu_charge_time_seconds` | `workloads[].usage.value` |\n"
"| `POST /v1/sessions`, `GET /v1/sessions/{id}` | `elapsed_time` | `usage.value` |\n"
"| `GET /v1/instances/usage` | `usage_consumed_seconds`, `usage_limit_seconds`, `usage_allocation_seconds` | `usage_consumed_ru`, `usage_limit_ru`, `usage_allocation_ru` |\n"
"| `GET /v1/accounts/{id}` | `plans[].usage_limit_seconds`, `plans[].usage_allocation_seconds`, `plans[].unallocated_usage_seconds` | `plans[].usage_limit_ru`, `plans[].usage_allocation_ru`, `plans[].unallocated_usage_ru` |\n"
"| Resource Controller API: Serviceinstanzen erstellen, aktualisieren und lesen | `instance_limit_seconds`, `usage_allocation_seconds` | `instance_limit_ru`, `usage_allocation_ru` |\n"
"| `GET /v1/analytics/usage`, `GET /v1/analytics/usage_grouped`, `GET /v1/analytics/usage_grouped_by_date` | Jedes Nutzungsfeld in Millisekunden | Das passende Feld mit dem Suffix `_ru` |\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The sections that follow give the details for each endpoint.\n"
msgstr "Die folgenden Abschnitte enthalten die Details zu jedem Endpunkt.\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Jobs {#jobs}"
msgstr "Jobs {#jobs}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Endpoints: `GET /v1/jobs` and `GET /v1/jobs/{id}/metrics`.\n"
msgstr "Endpunkte: `GET /v1/jobs` und `GET /v1/jobs/{id}/metrics`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Disregard | Read instead |\n"
"| --- | --- |\n"
"| `usage.qpu_charge_time_seconds` | `usage.value` |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Ignorieren | Stattdessen lesen |\n"
"| --- | --- |\n"
"| `usage.qpu_charge_time_seconds` | `usage.value` |\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The `usage` object also has these fields:\n"
msgstr "Das `usage`-Objekt enthält außerdem diese Felder:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`usage.unit`: The unit of `usage.value`. The value is always `\"resource_units\"`.\n"
msgstr "`usage.unit`: Die Einheit von `usage.value`. Der Wert ist immer `\"resource_units\"`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`usage.status`: The billing status. The value is `\"pending\"` or `\"complete\"`. If the status is `\"pending\"`, the platform can still change the value. Do not use a pending value as the final usage.\n"
msgstr "`usage.status`: Der Abrechnungsstatus. Der Wert ist `\"pending\"` oder `\"complete\"`. Wenn der Status `\"pending\"` ist, kann die Plattform den Wert noch ändern. Verwende einen ausstehenden Wert nicht als endgültige Nutzung.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`usage.details[]`: The usage for each billing metric. The `value` of each entry is in RUs.\n"
msgstr "`usage.details[]`: Die Nutzung für jede Abrechnungsmetrik. Der `value` jedes Eintrags ist in RUs angegeben.\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example:\n"
msgstr "Example:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The field `usage.details[].metric.value` is not the usage in RUs. It is the quantity of the metric that the platform used to calculate the RUs. Each metric has its own unit. For example, the unit of a QPU metric is seconds. For the usage, read `usage.details[].value`.\n"
msgstr "Das Feld `usage.details[].metric.value` ist nicht die Nutzung in RUs. Es ist die Menge der Metrik, aus der die Plattform die RUs berechnet hat. Jede Metrik hat ihre eigene Einheit. Die Einheit einer QPU-Metrik ist zum Beispiel Sekunden. Lies für die Nutzung `usage.details[].value`.\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Workloads {#workloads}"
msgstr "Workloads {#workloads}"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Endpoint: `GET /v1/workloads`.\n"
msgstr "Endpoint: `GET /v1/workloads`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Each item in `workloads[]` has a `usage` object. This object has the same fields as the `usage` object of a job.\n"
msgstr "Jedes Element in `workloads[]` hat ein `usage`-Objekt. Dieses Objekt hat dieselben Felder wie das `usage`-Objekt eines Jobs.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Disregard | Read instead |\n"
"| --- | --- |\n"
"| `workloads[].usage.qpu_charge_time_seconds` | `workloads[].usage.value` |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Ignorieren | Stattdessen lesen |\n"
"| --- | --- |\n"
"| `workloads[].usage.qpu_charge_time_seconds` | `workloads[].usage.value` |\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If a workload is still running, `usage` is `null`.\n"
msgstr "Wenn ein Workload noch läuft, ist `usage` gleich `null`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Function workloads {#function-workloads}"
msgstr "Funktions-Workloads {#function-workloads}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The usage of a function workload is in RUs, the same as for a QPU workload. A function workload can use more than one metric:\n"
msgstr "Die Nutzung eines Funktions-Workloads wird wie bei einem QPU-Workload in RUs angegeben. Ein Funktions-Workload kann mehr als eine Metrik verwenden:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**QPU usage.** This is metered per second of quantum time. See [Execution modes](/guides/execution-modes).\n"
msgstr "**QPU-Nutzung.** Sie wird pro Sekunde Quantenzeit gemessen. Siehe [Ausführungsmodi](/guides/execution-modes).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Classical compute usage.** This is metered per second of [classical time](/guides/managed-workflow-compute-profiles).\n"
msgstr "**Nutzung klassischer Rechenleistung.** Sie wird pro Sekunde [klassischer Zeit](/guides/managed-workflow-compute-profiles) gemessen.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Execution license cost.** This is metered per workload, based on the [size of the problem passed to a function](/guides/functions#overview-of-available-functions).\n"
msgstr "**Kosten der Ausführungslizenz.** Sie werden pro Workload gemessen, basierend auf der [Größe des an eine Funktion übergebenen Problems](/guides/functions#overview-of-available-functions).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The platform converts the quantity of each metric to RUs. Thus, all usage values are in RUs:\n"
msgstr "Die Plattform rechnet die Menge jeder Metrik in RUs um. Somit sind alle Nutzungswerte in RUs angegeben:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`usage.value` is the usage of the workload, in RUs.\n"
msgstr "`usage.value` ist die Nutzung des Workloads in RUs.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`usage.details[].value` is the usage for one metric, in RUs.\n"
msgstr "`usage.details[].value` ist die Nutzung für eine Metrik in RUs.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`usage.details[].metric.value` is the quantity of the metric, in the unit of that metric. It is not in RUs.\n"
msgstr "`usage.details[].metric.value` ist die Menge der Metrik in der Einheit dieser Metrik. Sie ist nicht in RUs angegeben.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you show or add usage values, use `usage.value` and `usage.details[].value`. Do not use `usage.details[].metric.value`.\n"
msgstr "Wenn du Nutzungswerte anzeigst oder addierst, verwende `usage.value` und `usage.details[].value`. Verwende nicht `usage.details[].metric.value`.\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Sessions {#sessions}"
msgstr "Sessions {#sessions}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Endpoints: `POST /v1/sessions` and `GET /v1/sessions/{id}`.\n"
msgstr "Endpunkte: `POST /v1/sessions` und `GET /v1/sessions/{id}`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Disregard | Read instead |\n"
"| --- | --- |\n"
"| `elapsed_time` (seconds) | `usage.value` |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Ignorieren | Stattdessen lesen |\n"
"| --- | --- |\n"
"| `elapsed_time` (Sekunden) | `usage.value` |\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The session `usage` object has `unit` and `details[]`. These fields work the same as in the job `usage` object, with the exception of the `status` field, which is omitted for sessions.\n"
msgstr "Das `usage`-Objekt einer Session hat `unit` und `details[]`. Diese Felder funktionieren genauso wie im `usage`-Objekt eines Jobs, mit Ausnahme des Felds `status`, das bei Sessions entfällt.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The fields `interactive_ttl`, `max_ttl`, and `active_ttl` do not change. They are time limits (TTL means \"time to live\"), not usage. Their unit stays seconds.\n"
msgstr "Die Felder `interactive_ttl`, `max_ttl` und `active_ttl` ändern sich nicht. Es sind Zeitlimits (TTL steht für \"time to live\"), keine Nutzung. Ihre Einheit bleibt Sekunden.\n"

