"| `plans[].usage_allocation_seconds` | `plans[].usage_allocation_ru` |\n"
"| `plans[].unallocated_usage_seconds` | `plans[].unallocated_usage_ru` |\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Service instances in the Resource Controller API {#service-instances-in-the-resource-controller-api}"
msgstr "Serviceinstanzen in der Resource Controller API {#service-instances-in-the-resource-controller-api}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The IBM Cloud&reg; Resource Controller API is a separate API. You use it to create and update service instances. If you create or update instances with this API, change the instance parameters too.\n"
msgstr "Die IBM Cloud&reg; Resource Controller API ist eine separate API. Du verwendest sie, um Serviceinstanzen zu erstellen und zu aktualisieren. Wenn du Instanzen mit dieser API erstellst oder aktualisierst, ändere auch die Instanzparameter.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "When you create or update an instance, send these parameters in the request:\n"
msgstr "Wenn du eine Instanz erstellst oder aktualisierst, sende diese Parameter in der Anfrage:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Don't send | Send instead | Type of the new parameter |\n"
"| --- | --- | --- |\n"
"| `instance_limit_seconds` | `instance_limit_ru` | Number or `null` |\n"
"| `usage_allocation_seconds` | `usage_allocation_ru` | Number or `null` |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Nicht senden | Stattdessen senden | Typ des neuen Parameters |\n"
"| --- | --- | --- |\n"
"| `instance_limit_seconds` | `instance_limit_ru` | Zahl oder `null` |\n"
"| `usage_allocation_seconds` | `usage_allocation_ru` | Zahl oder `null` |\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The parameters have these meanings:\n"
msgstr "Die Parameter haben folgende Bedeutung:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Instance limit**The maximum usage for the instance. If you do not send a limit on the Open Plan, the default is the RU equivalent of 10 minutes.\n"
msgstr "**Instanzlimit**Die maximale Nutzung der Instanz. Wenn du im Open Plan kein Limit sendest, ist der Standardwert das RU-Äquivalent von 10 Minuten.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Usage allocation**: The share of usage for the instance. The fair-share scheduler uses this value to set the priority of the instance in the queue. The allocation does not apply to Pay-As-You-Go instances.\n"
msgstr "**Nutzungszuteilung**: Der Nutzungsanteil der Instanz. Der Fair-Share-Scheduler verwendet diesen Wert, um die Priorität der Instanz in der Warteschlange festzulegen. Die Zuteilung gilt nicht für Pay-As-You-Go-Instanzen.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "When you read an instance, the `extensions` object in the response contains the old fields and the new fields. Disregard `instance_limit_seconds` and `usage_allocation_seconds`. Read `instance_limit_ru` and `usage_allocation_ru`.\n"
msgstr "Wenn du eine Instanz liest, enthält das `extensions`-Objekt in der Antwort die alten und die neuen Felder. Ignoriere `instance_limit_seconds` und `usage_allocation_seconds`. Lies `instance_limit_ru` und `usage_allocation_ru`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For more information, see the [IBM Quantum Compute Service REST API documentation](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-runtime-rest).\n"
msgstr "Weitere Informationen findest du in der [Dokumentation der IBM Quantum Compute Service REST API](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-runtime-rest).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Usage analytics {#usage-analytics}"
msgstr "Nutzungsanalysen {#usage-analytics}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Endpoints: `GET /v1/analytics/usage`, `GET /v1/analytics/usage_grouped`, and `GET /v1/analytics/usage_grouped_by_date`.\n"
msgstr "Endpunkte: `GET /v1/analytics/usage`, `GET /v1/analytics/usage_grouped` und `GET /v1/analytics/usage_grouped_by_date`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The three endpoints have the same usage fields. The two grouped endpoints return these fields for each group or each date.\n"
msgstr "Die drei Endpunkte haben dieselben Nutzungsfelder. Die beiden gruppierten Endpunkte liefern diese Felder für jede Gruppe bzw. jedes Datum.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
